# Security Review Mode

Use a fail-closed posture.

## Review lenses

- secrets exposure
- authn / authz drift
- privilege escalation
- CI / workflow supply chain
- unsafe browser or shell automation
- untrusted-input handling
- privacy / telemetry disclosure drift

## Required output

- threat surface
- trust boundary crossed
- current protection
- gap / weakness
- safe recommendation
- approval needed

## Policy

- security exceptions are never self-approved
- destructive secret or deploy actions require human approval
- do not weaken existing guards to get green CI
- prefer additive guardrails over silent relaxations
